              <p>Hello fellow hams,</p>

              <p>
                A quick reminder that the
                <strong>July Practice Hunt</strong> at
                <strong>Flaming Geyser State Park</strong> is
                one week from today &mdash;
                <strong>Sunday, July 19</strong>, starting at
                noon.
              </p>

              <h3 style="color:#1a3a5c;margin:20px 0 8px;">
                Quick Details
              </h3>
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                     border="0"
                     style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="140"
                      style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Date &amp; Time:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>Sunday, July 19, 2026</strong>,
                    Noon &ndash; 2:30&nbsp;PM
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Location:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>Flaming Geyser State Park</strong><br>
                    23700 SE Flaming Geyser Rd,
                    Auburn, WA&nbsp;98092
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Frequency:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    <strong>147.42&nbsp;MHz simplex</strong>
                    (callsign K7LED)
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="color:#555555;vertical-align:top;">
                    Parking:
                  </td>
                  <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                    Discover Pass required ($11.50/day or
                    $35/annual). Carpool if you can.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <h3 style="color:#1a3a5c;margin:20px 0 8px;">
                What to Bring
              </h3>
              <ul style="margin:8px 0;padding-left:20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  HT programmed to 147.42&nbsp;MHz &mdash; or
                  borrow one at the event
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Tape-measure Yagi antenna &mdash; or borrow
                  one at the event
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Step attenuator (for close-in work)
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  <strong>Discover Pass</strong> or $11.50 cash
                  for day-use parking
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Comfortable walking shoes, water, and a snack
                </li>
              </ul>

              <p>
                Still need loaner gear? Contact
                <strong>Tom Sayles, KE4HET</strong> at
                [TOM-EMAIL] before Sunday so we can plan
                accordingly.
              </p>

